# VyOS Web UI - Environment Variables

This file is for local development configuration. Copy this to `.env` and adjust the values.

```bash
# Your VyOS router's IP address
VITE_VYOS_ROUTER_IP=192.168.0.29
```

## Usage

1. Copy this file to `.env`:
   ```bash
   cp .env.example .env
   ```

2. Edit `.env` and change the IP to match your router

3. Restart the development server:
   ```bash
   npm run dev
   ```

The proxy will now target your router's IP address.

## Note

The `.env` file is gitignored so your local IP configuration won't be committed to the repository.
